# Wildlife Spotter — Environment Variables
# Copy to .env and fill in your values:  cp .env.example .env

# ─── AI Model Configuration ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Custom Wildlife Model Path
# Use a specialized African wildlife model for better accuracy
# Options:
#   1. Download from Roboflow Universe: https://universe.roboflow.com/
#   2. Use pre-trained models from Wildlife Insights or iNaturalist
#   3. Train your own with African wildlife datasets
#
# Place model file in models/ directory and set path here:
# WILDLIFE_MODEL_PATH=models/african-wildlife-yolov8.pt
# WILDLIFE_MODEL_PATH=models/wildlife-yolov8.pt
#
# If not set, defaults to standard YOLOv8n (includes some African animals)

# Detection confidence threshold (0.0 - 1.0, default 0.45)
# Lower = more detections but more false positives
# Higher = fewer detections but more accurate
# CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD=0.45

# ─── Alert Configuration ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Optional: Slack webhook for high/critical animal alerts
# SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.slack.com/services/YOUR/WEBHOOK/URL

# ─── Server Configuration ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Optional: Server port (default 8000)
# PORT=8000

# ─── Model Download Instructions ──────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# To use African wildlife models:
#
# 1. Roboflow Universe (Recommended):
#    - Visit: https://universe.roboflow.com/
#    - Search: "African wildlife" or "Big Five" or "Safari animals"
#    - Download YOLOv8 format (.pt file)
#    - Place in models/ directory
#
# 2. Custom Training:
#    - Use datasets from Kaggle, LILA BC, or your own camera trap images
#    - Train with: yolo train data=african-wildlife.yaml model=yolov8n.pt
#    - Export trained model to models/ directory
#
# 3. Pre-trained Options:
#    - MegaDetector (Microsoft): General wildlife detection
#    - Wildlife Insights models: Conservation-focused
#    - iNaturalist models: Species identification
#
# Example model names to look for:
#   - african-wildlife-yolov8.pt
#   - big-five-detector.pt
#   - safari-animals-yolov8.pt
#   - wildlife-camera-trap.pt